 "description": "<p>A leather leg garter with a heart accent in black, built on the same base construction as the collar line. The leather version of the garter runs firmer than the elastic formats - it holds its shape rather than stretching into it.</p>\n<p>The heart carries the design; the band does the work. Wear it solo or stacked with the chain collars from the same category.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: leg garter</li>\n<li>Style: heart</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm adjustment range</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The 40-50 cm range suits thigh placement on most frames. The leather garter for outfits where elastic reads too soft.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black leather leg garter with heart accent, 40-50 cm adjustment, structured band.</p>\n",
